---
import MainLayout from "../layouts/MainLayout.astro";
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import acupunctureImage from "../images/imageFive.png";
import nutritionImage from "../images/imageThree.png";
import naturalMedicineImage from "../images/imageSeven.png";
---

<MainLayout
  title="DETOXNatural | Bienestar personalizado"
  description="Acupuntura, nutrición personalizada y medicina natural. Conoce tu caso y encuentra el acompañamiento que mejor se adapta a ti."
  currentPath="/"
  headerVariant="overlay"
  headerTone="forest"
>
  <section data-hero-surface class="relative isolate flex min-h-screen min-h-[100svh] items-center overflow-hidden bg-[#263224] text-white">
    <div
      class="absolute inset-0 -z-20 hidden bg-cover bg-[position:65%_center] lg:block"
      style="background-image: url('/images/hero-home-fundador-bordado.png')"
    ></div>
    <div
      class="absolute inset-0 -z-20 bg-cover bg-[position:58%_center] lg:hidden"
      style="background-image: url('/images/hero-home-fundador-bordado-mobile.png')"
    ></div>
    <div class="absolute inset-0 -z-10 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#172117]/90 via-[#172117]/70 via-55% to-[#172117]/5"></div>
    <div class="absolute inset-0 -z-10 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#172117]/45 via-transparent to-[#172117]/10"></div>

    <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-6xl px-4 py-24 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 lg:py-28">
      <div class="max-w-2xl">
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#d7c18c] sm:text-base">
          DETOXNatural
        </p>
        <h1 class="mt-5 text-5xl font-semibold leading-[1.02] tracking-tight sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl">
          ¡Quítale peso a tu vida!
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-6 max-w-xl text-base leading-relaxed text-white/85 sm:text-lg">
          Acupuntura, nutrición y medicina natural, según tu caso.
        </p>
        <div class="absolute inset-x-4 bottom-24 z-10 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:static sm:mt-8 sm:flex-row">
          <a
            href="https://wa.me/529611448411?text=Hola%2C%20me%20gustar%C3%ADa%20agendar%20una%20consulta."
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#804184] px-7 py-3.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white shadow-lg shadow-black/25 transition hover:bg-[#5f255f] sm:text-base"
          >
            Agenda tu consulta
          </a>
          <a
            href="#servicios"
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-white/45 bg-white/5 px-7 py-3.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white backdrop-blur-sm transition hover:bg-white/15 sm:text-base"
          >
            Explora los servicios
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="servicios" class="bg-[#f8f5ef] py-16 sm:py-20">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-2xl">
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-purple-700">Elige por dónde empezar</p>
        <h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-[#2b2118] sm:text-4xl">
          Tres servicios. Un plan pensado para ti.
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-4 max-w-xl text-base text-[#685c50]">
          Puedes comenzar con un servicio individual y, si lo necesitas, complementar tu proceso.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-9 grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-3">
        <a href="/acupuntura" class="group relative isolate flex min-h-[340px] flex-col justify-end overflow-hidden rounded-[1.75rem] bg-[#25130b] p-6 text-white shadow-lg shadow-[#352116]/10 transition hover:-translate-y-1 sm:p-7">
          <Image src={acupunctureImage} alt="Tratamiento de acupuntura" class="absolute inset-0 -z-20 h-full w-full object-cover transition duration-500 group-hover:scale-105" />
          <div class="absolute inset-0 -z-10 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#1b0b05]/95 via-[#1b0b05]/35 to-transparent"></div>
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#f3c68e]">Medicina Tradicional China</p>
          <h3 class="mt-2 text-3xl font-semibold">Acupuntura</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 max-w-sm text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/85">Sesiones personalizadas para acompañar tu equilibrio y bienestar.</p>
          <span class="mt-5 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-white">Conoce el servicio <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span>
        </a>

        <a href="/nutricion" class="group relative isolate flex min-h-[340px] flex-col justify-end overflow-hidden rounded-[1.75rem] bg-[#17261a] p-6 text-white shadow-lg shadow-[#352116]/10 transition hover:-translate-y-1 sm:p-7">
          <Image src={nutritionImage} alt="Alimentos frescos y nutritivos" class="absolute inset-0 -z-20 h-full w-full object-cover transition duration-500 group-hover:scale-105" />
          <div class="absolute inset-0 -z-10 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#101c13]/95 via-[#101c13]/40 to-transparent"></div>
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#d8dca2]">Guía nutricional</p>
          <h3 class="mt-2 text-3xl font-semibold">Nutrición</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 max-w-sm text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/85">Estrategias de alimentación adaptadas a tus objetivos y rutina.</p>
          <span class="mt-5 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-white">Conoce el servicio <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span>
        </a>

        <a href="/medicina-natural" class="group relative isolate flex min-h-[340px] flex-col justify-end overflow-hidden rounded-[1.75rem] bg-[#17261a] p-6 text-white shadow-lg shadow-[#352116]/10 transition hover:-translate-y-1 sm:p-7">
          <Image src={naturalMedicineImage} alt="Plantas medicinales y fitoterapia" class="absolute inset-0 -z-20 h-full w-full object-cover transition duration-500 group-hover:scale-105" />
          <div class="absolute inset-0 -z-10 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#101c13]/95 via-[#101c13]/40 to-transparent"></div>
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#d8dca2]">Plantas y bienestar</p>
          <h3 class="mt-2 text-3xl font-semibold">Medicina natural</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 max-w-sm text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/85">Fitoterapia y recomendaciones integradas a tu proceso.</p>
          <span class="mt-5 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-white">Conoce el servicio <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-[#21120b] py-16 text-white sm:py-20">
    <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-10 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:grid-cols-[0.9fr_1.1fr] lg:items-center lg:px-8">
      <div>
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#d7b2d9]">Tu proceso empieza escuchándote</p>
        <h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl">Primero conocemos tu caso.</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 max-w-lg text-base leading-relaxed text-[#e3d3c4]">
          Cada persona es distinta. La consulta nos ayuda a entender tu historia y orientarte hacia el servicio adecuado.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-3">
        <article class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.04] p-5">
          <span class="text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.16em] text-[#d7b2d9]">01</span>
          <h3 class="mt-3 font-semibold">Te escuchamos</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#cbbdaf]">Conocemos tu historia y objetivos.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.04] p-5">
          <span class="text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.16em] text-[#d7b2d9]">02</span>
          <h3 class="mt-3 font-semibold">Te orientamos</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#cbbdaf]">Exploramos opciones para tu caso.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.04] p-5">
          <span class="text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.16em] text-[#d7b2d9]">03</span>
          <h3 class="mt-3 font-semibold">Armamos tu plan</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#cbbdaf]">Definimos contigo los siguientes pasos.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-[#f8f5ef] px-4 py-16 text-center sm:px-6 sm:py-20">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-[#2b2118] sm:text-4xl">Empieza por una conversación</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base text-[#685c50]">Cuéntanos qué buscas y te orientamos sobre cómo comenzar.</p>
      <a
        href="https://wa.me/529611448411?text=Hola%2C%20me%20gustar%C3%ADa%20agendar%20una%20consulta."
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="mt-7 inline-flex rounded-full bg-[#804184] px-7 py-3.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white shadow-md shadow-purple-950/15 transition hover:bg-[#5f255f]"
      >
        Agenda tu consulta
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</MainLayout>
